                <p class="summary">
                    Dynamic and results-driven Graphic Designer, Engineering Student & ROM Developer with 4+ years of hands-on experience building innovative digital solutions. Founder of Ninety5 Studio. Specialized in web development, custom Android ROMs, and creative design with expertise in UI/UX, 3D visualization, and video production. Proven track record of serving 100+ clients with 400+ designs delivered worldwide. Currently pursuing B.E in Computer Science at Dhaanish Ahmed College of Engineering while maintaining an active freelance practice. Passionate about creating seamless user experiences and pushing the boundaries of technology.
                </p>
