                    </div>
                    <p class="item-description">
                        Founded and operate a freelance digital design studio, delivering comprehensive web development and design solutions to clients globally. Manage full project lifecycle from initial consultation to deployment and maintenance.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="achievements-list">
                        <li>Successfully served 100+ clients with 400+ designs delivered and 98% client retention rate</li>
                        <li>Architected and deployed scalable web applications serving 2000+ active users</li>
